# ZenMux Starter quota

The oil-motion key is a **Starter Builder Plan** subscription key (`sk-subs-…`).

- Stay at or under **50 Flows per rolling 5-hour window**. Do not hit Extra Usage / pay-as-you-go overflow.
- One image or video call at a time. State estimated Flows and the window total before each call.
- Stop and ask if a call would exceed the window or if cost is unclear. No automatic retries.
- Test with `--dry-run` and low/medium quality. High quality only after the user approves a frame.
